# Integer32 power within range

Verifies int32 exponentiation with base and exponent chosen to stay inside
the 32-bit range through the complete CLI pipeline. Both operands are int32
to keep this case focused on same-type power semantics.

>>> source
const base: int32 = 2
const exponent: int32 = 30

const power: int32 = base ** exponent
print(power)

<<< stdout
1073741824

<<< stderr
